// Kasturisundari Chain — Sample Vedic Smart Contract
// This contract demonstrates allocating variables and performing basic arithmetic 
// using Panini's Sutras as opcodes.

वृद्धिरादैच्      // OP_ALLOC (pushes 0 to initialize stack)
100               // PUSH argument
50                // PUSH argument
अकः सवर्णे दीर्घः // OP_ADD (adds 50 + 100 = 150)
इको यणचि          // OP_SUB (subtracts 150 from 0)
                  // OP_END is implicitly appended by the compiler
